{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117872","id":3452682492,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Ny8D8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117872","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117872.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117872.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117872","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117872/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117872/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117872/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7c5bb6c03d7f9bcbf3b9a9be0166e34f3e8c3890","number":117872,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[Unix] Fix global state pollution in `DirAccessUnix::change_dir`","user":{"login":"zorbathut","id":160754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut","html_url":"https://github.com/zorbathut","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorbathut/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Replace `chdir`/`getcwd` with `stat`/`access`/`realpath` to validate directories without temporarily changing the process-wide working directory, which caused race conditions in multithreaded contexts.\r\n\r\nFixes #115321.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nHere's the C# test I ended up putting in my test suite to verify that this doesn't happen again:\r\n\r\n```cs\r\n// project.godot is guaranteed to exist in the CWD\r\nconst string relativePath = \"project.godot\";\r\n\r\n// Sanity check: the file must exist right now\r\nAssert.IsTrue(File.Exists(relativePath), $\"Precondition failed: {relativePath} does not exist from CWD {Directory.GetCurrentDirectory()}\");\r\n\r\nconst int iterations = 10000;\r\nbool raceDetected = false;\r\nstring failedCwd = null;\r\n\r\nvar readerThread = new Thread(() =>\r\n{\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < iterations; i++)\r\n    {\r\n        if (!File.Exists(relativePath))\r\n        {\r\n            raceDetected = true;\r\n            failedCwd = Directory.GetCurrentDirectory();\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\nvar dirAccessThread = new Thread(() =>\r\n{\r\n    for (int i = 0; i < iterations; i++)\r\n    {\r\n        if (raceDetected)\r\n        {\r\n            break;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // This triggers DirAccessUnix::change_dir(\"user://\") internally,\r\n        // which temporarily chdir's the process to the user data directory.\r\n        using (var da = Godot.DirAccess.Open(\"user://\"))\r\n        {\r\n            // just opening and closing is enough to trigger the race\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n});\r\n\r\nreaderThread.Start();\r\ndirAccessThread.Start();\r\n\r\nreaderThread.Join();\r\ndirAccessThread.Join();\r\n\r\nAssert.IsFalse(raceDetected, $\"Race detected: File.Exists failed because CWD was temporarily changed to '{failedCwd}'\");\r\n```\r\n\r\nI can replicate something of the sort in C++ if you want it added to Godot tests, but it's kind of a weird specialized test to add to the suite forever.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nThis is mostly a bugfix, but contains one behavior change, which is that trying to chdir outside the root path will now give an error instead of returning success but doing nothing.\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nUsed Claude to find the original bug and write the first version of the fix. Then did a lot of tweaking and polishing. This carries my personal stamp of approval.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"htt